ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=71MxS5s8RvUQ7kNvwFtgQTc&_nc_oc=AdrK-PTXNWy42mKcSMQOwAn1aJrJDsFb4_zALWeFAAX5yBjuiQrKUJpGNy4fpQBtVRE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7wniVGMBkxv_ZbT3X1a17lXXykoIa8oVp4cvieqr8VZw&oe=6A1EF4FC"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2fzn4XI9ldMQ7kNvwF7GcZ-&_nc_oc=Adp5-HPCyEzwl8JhsHZVLngsm-JWLgXKIhogV7nAjLWeYoYox_1SY92nQrVa6ut3jG8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7hQPJBFSKej8uX2bW_WeyqqPOp2um5sNms_vjbW67ZQA&oe=6A1ED916"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iJfNDLnEzs4Q7kNvwEsn5H2&_nc_oc=AdqKCZ4TqzRUNPCZ554l3iYhkRjYF16-fbNvRFQ6c4l4SxYjGVeiwH1Y_LaQV2rj9Zg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af70Snf4di94_4Ffi60KtFHt4dV2sAuPJZUIpeHxsG9QWA&oe=6A1EE6E4"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_